FINDING TABLE
======================================================================
  RAISES (explicit error): 4
  SILENT (passes through): 5
  Other (FIRED / OK):      2

Interpretation:
  By design (src/scenario.py docstring), build_config does NOT validate
  physiological bounds. Defense in depth = Pulse-side rejection (clamped
  flag) + post-hoc implausible flag. The findings above confirm that
  contract: only scenario_key / sex_key raise; all physiological out-of-
  envelope values pass through silently and rely on Pulse + detector.
